# ── REPOSITORY SCOPE (owner decision, 2026-11-27) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Everything else is tracked, so no work lives on one computer only: renders (out/), product images
# (public/assets/, public/products/), internal documents (docs/internal/), the archive and the audio.
# The owner is switching the repository to private; until then all of it is public.
#
# Zip bundles in out/ only repeat files tracked beside them, and GitHub refuses files over 100 MB.
out/**/*.zip
